         * @since 6.8.2
         *
         * @return void
         */
        abstract public function hook(): void;
        /**
         * Whether the promotional content is dismissible.
         * Defaults to false, the Is_Dismissible trait must be used to override this.
         *
         * @since 6.9.8
         *
         * @return bool
